# Copy to .env and fill in. See docs/ai-log.md for the model-selection
# reasoning. QueryGeneration is the one stage that invents the structured
# filter/metric proposal from free-form Hebrew text with no later chance to
# correct a misunderstanding, so it uses xAI's best available model
# (grok-4.6) even though it is the slowest stage. The other three stages
# (verification, summarization, result-verification) only check or describe
# an already-structured proposal, so the fast/cheap grok-4-fast model is
# both sufficient and keeps the overall round trip fast. Any valid xAI model
# id works; all four stages can be set independently.
Llm__ApiKey=
Llm__Models__QueryGeneration=grok-4.6
Llm__Models__QueryVerification=grok-4-fast
Llm__Models__ResultSummary=grok-4-fast
Llm__Models__ResultVerification=grok-4-fast
